      "chapter": "normalization",
      "title": "Cancellation between matched derivatives of the diagram minors",
      "anchor": "normalization-paired-cap",
      "statement": "For a fixed pair of labels with diagrams α and β, the n-th power of the matched Laplacian kills the product of all chosen column minors when n>|α|−α₀+min(α₀,β₀). Here each diagram row and the increasing column choices enter the determinant in the given order.",
